This repository contains Nix packaging for the OpenCode CLI (flake.nix,
package.nix, update scripts, GitHub Actions, and related files). That
packaging is licensed under the MIT License below.

This repository does **not** include the OpenCode binary. The flake records
official download URLs and hashes; Nix fetches the Linux tarball at build
time. OpenCode itself is published under the MIT License by Anomaly. Use of
that binary is governed by its license, not by this file.

This project is unofficial and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Anomaly.

